Package: der
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | openjdk-17-jre-headless, postgresql-17 | postgresql-16 | postgresql-15, adduser
Recommends: nginx, fail2ban, apparmor
Maintainer: DER Engineering <socaya@stephocay.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/socaya/der-engine
Description: DHIS2 Edge Runtime appliance
 DER is an edge appliance that keeps a facility running when the
 central DHIS2 server is unreachable. It mirrors metadata, buffers
 data entry, and syncs when connectivity returns.
 .
 Includes:
   * Spring Boot coordination service (/opt/der/der-server.jar)
   * Admin UI (served at /admin/)
   * Device-client PWA (served at /)
   * systemd unit, AppArmor profile, nginx config, fail2ban jail
